 "words_heard": 216,
 "words": 220,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Who has believed our message",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And to whom was the arm revealed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He grew like a root in dry ground",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No beauty to draw our eyes",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Despised and rejected by men",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A man of sorrows and grief",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We hid our faces from him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And held him of no account",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet it was our griefs he bore",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Our sorrows he carried alone",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We thought him struck by God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But pierced for our transgressions",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Crushed for our iniquities",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By his wounds we are healed",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The punishment brought us peace",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Laid upon him was the weight",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All we have strayed like sheep",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Turned to our own ways",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Lord laid on him",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
